SUMMARY:Gallery Talk: Max Gruber on 90 YEARS
LOCATION:ICA\, 25 Harbor Shore Dr\, Boston\, MA 02210
DESCRIPTION:Founded in 1936\, the ICA is one of the oldest museums dedicate
 d to contemporary art in the United States. On this special anniversary\, 
 90 YEARS revisits nine exhibitions and initiatives from the ICA’s histor
 y\, tracing the museum’s evolution alongside the ever-changing landscape
  of contemporary art. Join Curatorial Assistant Max Gruber for a conversat
 ion about pivotal moments in the ICA’s history with a focus on the landm
 ark 1941 exhibition Modern Mexican Painters.\nhttps://www.icaboston.org/ev
 ents/gallery-talk-max-gruber-on-90-years/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pu
 shpin.city/
URL:https://www.icaboston.org/events/gallery-talk-max-gruber-on-90-years/
END:VEVENT
